---
layout: base.njk
title: Add a list
permalink: /contribute/
---
<div class="wrap section">
  <div class="stack">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contribute</p>
    <h1>Check a CSV or add a list</h1>
    <p class="lede">Check an existing CSV straight away. Source details and AI assistance are optional steps when you want to add a new list.</p>
    <p class="note">Your CSV stays in this browser. Checking it does not add it to the catalogue.</p>
  </div>
  <noscript><p class="note">Enable JavaScript to prepare and review a contribution. You can still <a href="/data/">download existing data</a>.</p></noscript>
  <p id="load-status" role="status">Loading the list editor…</p>
  <form id="contribute-form" class="stack" novalidate hidden>
    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Check a CSV</h2>
      <p>Start here. You do not need a title, source details or a review confirmation to check a file.</p>
      <p>Upload a UTF-8 CSV (up to 5 MB and 20,000 entries), or paste CSV text. The only required column is <code>name_as_printed</code>. Use the template for the other supported columns. Spreadsheet headings such as <code>#</code>, <code>name as printed</code>, <code>amount (£.s.d)</code>, <code>linked to</code>, <code>via</code> and <code>checked</code> also work. Review flags are kept in notes. Use <code>agent_as_printed</code> for an intermediary’s name and <code>agent_id</code> for a known catalogue link.</p>
      <label for="csv-file">Choose a CSV file</label><input id="csv-file" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv">
      <label for="csv-text">CSV text (editable)</label><textarea id="csv-text" rows="10" spellcheck="false" placeholder="name_as_printed,place_as_printed,amount,certainty,note"></textarea>
      <p class="small-note">Amounts use separate units: £1 10s. 6d. becomes <code>1.10.6</code>; $12.50 becomes <code>12.50</code>. Leave unknown amounts blank. Leave entity and place IDs blank unless you know their catalogue IDs; place names can go in <code>place_as_printed</code>.</p>
        <div class="field"><label for="list-currency">Default currency</label><select id="list-currency" name="currency"><option value="">No amounts / unknown</option></select></div>
      <p class="small-note">Choose a currency if amounts do not have their own currency column. Otherwise, amounts are checked for numeric format only.</p>
      <div class="filter-bar"><button class="btn" type="submit">Check CSV</button><button class="btn btn-quiet" id="template" type="button">Download CSV template</button></div>
      <div id="review-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <section id="duplicate-report" class="panel" hidden aria-labelledby="duplicate-heading">
        <h3 id="duplicate-heading">Possible duplicates</h3>
        <p>Compare these entries before adding the list. Repeated names may be legitimate; no rows are removed automatically.</p>
        <div id="duplicate-matches"></div>
        <label class="check"><input id="duplicate-reviewed" type="checkbox">I reviewed the possible duplicates; any remaining repeats are intentional.</label>
      </section>
      <div id="preview" class="stack" hidden>
        <div class="table-box"><table><caption id="preview-caption"></caption><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Section</th><th>Name as printed</th><th>Place</th><th>Amount</th><th>Via / intermediary</th><th>Certainty</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody id="preview-rows"></tbody></table></div>
        <div class="filter-bar"><button class="btn btn-quiet" id="preview-prev" type="button">Previous entries</button><button class="btn btn-quiet" id="preview-next" type="button">Next entries</button></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <details class="panel" id="contribution-details">
      <summary>Prepare a contribution for the catalogue</summary>
      <p>Add source details when you are ready to contribute this CSV.</p>
      <p>Use the publication date and a link to the original page. Fields marked * are required.</p>
      <div class="contribution-fields">
        <div class="field"><label for="list-title">List title *</label><input id="list-title" name="title" type="text" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="list-id">List ID *</label><input id="list-id" name="id" type="text" required aria-describedby="id-help"><small id="id-help">A unique short name, such as brussa-relief-1855.</small></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="list-date">Publication date *</label><input id="list-date" name="date" type="text" placeholder="1855-10-19" required><small>YYYY, YYYY-MM, YYYY-MM-DD or a range such as 1838/1839</small></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="list-type">List type *</label><select id="list-type" name="list_type"><option value="donation">Donations</option><option value="subscription">Subscriptions</option><option value="membership">Membership</option><option value="pledge">Pledges</option><option value="offering">Offerings / dedications</option><option value="debt">Bills / arrears</option><option value="bequest">Charitable bequests</option><option value="agents">Agents</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="list-source">Publication / source *</label><select id="list-source" name="source_id"><option value="__new__">Add a new source</option></select></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="source-title">New source title</label><input id="source-title" type="text"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="source-url">Link to the original page *</label><input id="source-url" type="url" required placeholder="https://…"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="list-citation">Volume / issue</label><input id="list-citation" name="citation" type="text" placeholder="Vol. 12, no. 44"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="list-pages">Page(s)</label><input id="list-pages" name="pages" type="text" placeholder="p. 348"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="list-purpose">Purpose of the list</label><input id="list-purpose" name="purpose" type="text"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="list-transcriber">Transcriber / credit</label><input id="list-transcriber" name="transcriber" type="text" placeholder="Your name; AI-assisted if applicable"></div>
      </div>
    <button class="btn" id="prepare-contribution" type="button">Check contribution details</button>
      <div id="contribution-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div id="contribution-ready" class="stack" hidden>
        <label class="check"><input id="reviewed" type="checkbox">I checked the entries against the original and marked uncertain readings.</label>
        <button class="btn" id="export" type="button" disabled>Download contribution for the editor</button>
        <p class="small-note">Download the contribution and send it to the project editor. It includes source details and all entries, and will enter the catalogue as a draft for independent checking.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="panel">
      <summary>Need help transcribing with AI?</summary>
      <p>Copy this prompt into your preferred AI assistant and attach a clear scan of the list. Ask for a CSV file, then upload the resulting CSV above. You can also fill in the template yourself.</p>
      <label for="ai-prompt">Transcription prompt</label>
      <textarea id="ai-prompt" rows="10" readonly></textarea>
      <div class="filter-bar"><button class="btn btn-quiet" id="copy-prompt" type="button">Copy prompt</button><a href="/data/">Browse existing list downloads</a></div>
      <p id="copy-status" role="status"></p>
    </details>
  </form>
</div>
<script src="/assets/contribution.js" defer></script>
<script src="/assets/contribute-ui.js" defer></script>
